      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Ryze's spells deal extra damage based on his Bonus Mana, and he gains a percentage increase to his maximum Mana based on his Ability Power.",
      "summary_zh": "瑞兹的技能会造成基于他法力值加成的额外伤害，并且他的最大法力值会基于他的法术强度来获得百分比的提升。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309524:4005387"
      ]
